# Analysis plan: sample-pca

Status: DRAFT

An analysis runs only after a person has read this file and approved it. Edit anything;
approval is what freezes it. After approval the plan is the record of intent -- change of
mind means a new analysis, not a quiet edit.

## Goal
Show how the six bulk RNA-seq samples relate to one another with a PCA of the samples computed
from the gene counts, coloured by condition (untreated vs treated). The deliverable is the PCA
plot plus the per-sample PC scores and per-component variance explained behind it; judging
whether samples group by condition is left to the reader.

