## Execution
Runs: batch
One batch job through the workspace's configured executor (`_system/executorlib.py submit`):
1 CPU, 4 GB memory, 30-minute limit. Expected wall time is under 5 minutes for 6 samples. All
outputs together should be under 1 MB.
